  "title": "Hearty Savory Algerian Perilla Leaf Tagine",
  "description": "A savory and adventurous Algerian dish featuring perilla leaves, this tagine is made with a variety of spices and pressure-cooked to perfection, creating a glassy-jelly texture that is both unique and delicious.",
