  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the pressure cooker over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the perilla leaves and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the pressure cooker and bring to a boil.",
    "Close the lid and cook for 20 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
